  "body": "G.J. Gardner Homes House and Land Package featuring a Custom design.\r\n\r\nWelcome to this impressive and expansive 5 bedroom home perfectly positioned in Long Bay offering the ideal blend of convenience, comfort and lifestyle. This home is designed for  modern family living and entertaining. With huge outdoor decks, there is plenty of space to unwind and relax, while soaking up the sun. 2 full bathrooms, 2 stand alone toilets, open plan living that flow effortlessly to outdoor spaces. This home offers a rare mix of space and functionality making it perfect for everyone. Don't miss this opportunity - properties of this size and caliber don't come along often!\r\n\r\nYour plan, our plans, or we can design from scratch. For more information visit our website http://www.gjgardner.co.nz\r\nMORE NEW ZEALANDERS TRUST G.J. GARDNER TO BUILD THEIR HOMES THAN ANY OTHER BUILDER.\r\n\r\nIf you’re thinking about building, make Home Prep the first step in your journey. It’s our essential step-by-step guide to the building process. Full of independent advice and handy information to help you have a great building experience. Get your free copy from gjgardner.co.nz today.\r\n\r\n*Price is an indication only and includes land. Some conditions may apply. Image is artist’s impression only.\r\n\r\nCopyright G.J. Gardner Homes",
